  "releaseNotes": "Previous versions of ctxsignlib included refactored and restructured components by ChatGPT 5.2 that introduced unintended API drift. In particular, the semantics of --thumb, --pin, and --pubpin became inconsistent across surfaces, which could lead to confusion or misconfiguration.\n\nThis release corrects and formalizes those contracts to ensure strict, deterministic pin behavior moving forward.",
